From ab225d772002949531c11cf8fc242ef863580690 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:44:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1796/3799] soh: rename D_8012AC90 -> sRoomFaceTexOffsets

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the four 0x10000-step texture offsets, one per face of a room skybox.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_vr_box.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_vr_box.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_vr_box.c b/soh/src/code/z_vr_box.c
index 74e68bfa1..d5c107d3f 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_vr_box.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_vr_box.c
@@ -75,7 +75,8 @@
 #include "soh/Enhancements/game-interactor/GameInteractor.h"
 #include "soh/Enhancements/game-interactor/GameInteractor_Hooks.h"
 
-u32 D_8012AC90[4] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_8012AC90: the four 0x10000-step texture offsets, one per face of a room skybox.
+u32 sRoomFaceTexOffsets[4] = {  // was D_8012AC90 [LLM:HIGH]
     0x00000000,
     0x00010000,
     0x00020000,
-- 
2.55.0

